<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Eric Linder on Monday started coverage of Mexican construction company Bufete Industrial SA de CV with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Linder said construction of Mexican oil, petrochemical and power generation facilities &quot;is set to explode.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He added, &quot;We expect Bufete to overcome its short backlog and highly leveraged financial position ... (and) the one-year outlook outweighs near-term backlog risk.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Linder set a 1997 earnings per share estimate for Bufete's American Depositary Receipts of $0.40 and of $1.14 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- The company's ADRs closed on Friday at 18-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
